<li>Ngusap &lt;a href="pameunteu"&gt;pameunteu&lt;/a&gt; ku kekebul atawa &lt;a href="taneuh"&gt;taneuh&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Ngusap dua leungeun ku kekebul atawa &lt;a href="taneuh"&gt;taneuh&lt;/a&gt; nepi ka siku.</li>
